The '''gourmet impling''' is an [[impling]] that can be caught in the [[Impetuous Impulses]] [[minigame]], and are located throughout [[Puro-Puro]] and [[Gielinor]]. It is caught with either a [[Butterfly net|normal]] or [[magic butterfly net]] equipped with 28 [[Hunter]], or 38 Hunter barehanded. Capturing a gourmet impling will grant the player 22 (if caught on Puro-Puro) or 24 (if caught on Gielinor) Hunter experience. If caught with an empty [[impling jar]] in the player's inventory, the result is a [[gourmet impling jar]], otherwise the impling is looted immediately.

When the gourmet impling is finally caught, the player can either free it from the [[gourmet impling jar]], which will leave an item behind, or trade it to [[Elnock Inquisitor]] for special items. The player can either get 3 [[impling jar]]s for one gourmet impling or, with 3 [[baby impling]]s and 2 [[young impling]], can get a can of [[imp repellent]], or alternatively can trade 3 gourmet implings with 2 [[earth impling]]s and an [[essence impling]] to receive a magic butterfly net.

