==Loot==
At current [[Grand Exchange]] prices, opening a gourmet impling jar gives {{Coins|{{ImpValue|gourmet|jar=yes}} round 0}} worth of loot, on average. This means opening gourmet impling jars makes an average profit of {{Coins|{{ImpValue|gourmet|jar=yes}}-{{GEP|Gourmet impling jar}} round 0}} per jar, however this does not include loot from clue scrolls.

On average, one would profit {{Coins|25*({{ImpValue|gourmet|jar=yes}}-{{GEP|Gourmet impling jar}}) round 0}} to get an [[clue scroll (easy)|easy clue scroll]] from gourmet impling jars at current [[Grand Exchange]] prices, excluding the rewards from the completed [[Treasure Trail]]s.

